{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20269rxFcNtoIz1795389493.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>印尼一間糖果工廠發生火警，至今最少3人死亡、4人受傷，逾30人失蹤。當局不排除死亡人數會上升。</p><p></p><p>事發在周六晚，涉事工廠位於萬丹省，主要生產本地品牌的牛奶糖與零食等。廠方表示，事發時現場有60多人。搜索工作昨晚暫停，今日早上會恢復進行。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.INDO.FIRE 1830 UP0200.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026hoN8tod1uk1795389381.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>當局指由於火勢猛烈，現場發現的遺體嚴重燒毀，無法憑外觀辨認身份，目前正採集失蹤工人家屬DNA樣本，幫助確認遇難者身份，預計需時兩至三個星期，而火警原因仍在調查。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:23:52.928247+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T23:06:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T07:45:30.552875+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T00:17:37.503868+00:00","content_hash":"c332ed332df3157db58c99b3f1194b4e6d1f267cbecf79fc2d9d038d3a2f4bff","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T00:23:52.928247+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}